    "## Summary\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook provides a **generic gap-filling pipeline** that works for any satellite ocean variable:\n",
    "\n",
    "### Key advantages:\n",
    "1. **Not hardcoded to chlorophyll** - specify any target variable\n",
    "2. **No ground truth needed** - uses synthetic clouds for training/evaluation\n",
    "3. **Simple data requirements** - just target, missing flag, and land flag\n",
    "4. **Extensible** - add custom features (SST, winds, etc.)\n",
